{"meta":{"format_version":"5.0","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"cannon_bronze_fixed","model_identifier":"cannon_bronze_fixed","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","multi_file_ruleset":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# cannon_bronze_fixed\n\nFixed bronze cannon for the Citadel's engine platform (Patch 5): the remade thick-walled, small-bore bronze barrel on a timber cradle with stepped cheeks, knee braces, a quoin under the breech and iron straps; no wheels or axle. It is built from `cannon_bronze` and keeps its bones and clips except the wheels; it cannot move.\n\n- Placement: its origin sits on the Citadel's `slot_engine`, facing -Z; its crewmen stand at `slot_crew_1` and `slot_crew_2`.\n- Bounds: x -14..14, y 0..35, z -27..24 units.\n- Texture: 256 x 128, 1 px per unit, flat pixel-art tones per material.\n- Cubes: 67.\n\n## Clips\n\n- `idle` (4 s, loop)\n- `fire` (2.4 s)\n- `reload` (3 s)\n- `aim` (3 s, loop)\n- `damaged` (0.7 s)\n- `destroyed` (1.6 s)\n\n(`move` and `move_towed` are removed: a fixed engine never moves.)\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `fx_muzzle` at (0, 25.5, -27.2)\n- `slot_muzzle` at (0, 25.5, -27.2)\n- `slot_crew_1` at (16, 0, 28)\n- `slot_crew_2` at (-16, 0, 28)"},"resolution":{"width":256,"height":128},"elements":[{"name":"beam_bucket","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[4.2,5.5,17],"to":[7.7,9.5,20.5],"autouv":0,"color":0,"origin":[6,11,18.75],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[210,89,214,93],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[214,89,218,93],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[218,89,222,93],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[222,89,226,93],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[226,89,230,93],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[230,89,234,93],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"f4004326-d138-52bd-b0bd-3961532ec7a2"},{"name":"iron_bucket_bail","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export"